Few new changes to the Wiki:

o You must be logged in to edit pages.  The way I figure: beat the
spam bots before they come.  This will be annoying, I know, but I hate
spam enough to make that change.
o The default theme now loads less images.  Bandwidth isn't an issue
for my server, but it'll make load times faster on you.  You can
change to any theme in your preferences if you want.  The default
theme is changed.  That's all.

